Package: dns-panel-pulse-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sergey Denisov <4402989@gmail.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ds1919/dns-panel
Description: DNS Panel NS Pulse tester (pulse-agent)
 Runs ICMP/TCP checks from a site for the DNS Panel NS Pulse and reports them to the panel's pulse-server.
 Put the file from the panel (NS Pulse -> Agent config) into /opt/dns-panel/etc/pulse-agent.toml, start the
 agent and approve its request in the panel (NS Pulse -> Waiting for approval).
